OL,3,AThomas Markle charged over child sex
OL,4,Aabuse material in Philippines
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice in the Philippines have charged
OL,7,FThomas Markle Sr, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, with possession of
OL,9,Fand intent to distribute child sexual
OL,10,Fabuse material.
OL,12,FThe charges were filed on Monday, Cebu
OL,13,Fprovince prosecutor Graeme Elmido told
OL,14,Fthe BBC.
