OL,3,AThomas Markle charged over child sex
OL,4,Aabuse material in Philippines
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this month, Markle, 82, was
OL,7,Fseparately arrested and charged in the
OL,8,FUS with possession of child sexual
OL,9,Fabuse material. The FBI said agents,
OL,10,Fafter searching storage units Markle
OL,11,Frented, seized about 78 items,
OL,12,Fincluding film negatives, slides and
OL,13,Fbooks, that they allege contained child
OL,14,Fsex abuse material.
OL,16,FMarkle, who is in custody, has
OL,17,Fpreviously denied the allegations. The
OL,18,FBBC has contacted Markle's attorney in
OL,19,Fthe US for comment.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
